Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:07.61,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,There it is. The city-state of Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.95,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'd heard it was deep in the mountains...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:13.53,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,But it's practically merged with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.85,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,How'd they build a city \Nin the middle of the range?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:19.02,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,You see, it was the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.17,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The city wasn't built in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:24.75,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The mountains were built around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.03,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They {\i1}built{\i0} the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:29.63,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The city was originally\Nfounded in the Xarles era
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:32.88,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,as an outpost to defend against demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:37.10,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,High-quality ore veins were\N later discovered in the land below,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.33,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,so we pushed the earth up\N to bring them to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:45.73,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,In other words, the mountains \Nthemselves {\i1}are{\i0} the ore veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:49.37,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Huh. Ancient magic must've \Nreally been something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:56.13,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,They have human riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:59.37,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,That's the crest of the Gargan Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Those are the empire's wyvern knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:07.81,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,So they've tamed wyverns? Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:10.31,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What are they doing in Karan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:15.63,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I hope it's got nothing to do\N with what we're here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:00.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We are envoys from Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:03.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'd like an audience with the ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.94,Default,GUARD,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:06.83,Default,GUARD,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.29,Default,GUARD,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.35,0:03:16.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,There are a lot of dwarves here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.94,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Elves and dwarves don't get along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.50,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Th-Their disdain for us is entirely one-sided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.68,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I've no strong feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.13,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.70,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I am Miranda, the Zirgian ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:37.32,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,You must be Queen Milena's messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Delighted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My name is Kyle Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:49.10,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Your reputation precedes you in Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.50,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Please, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:55.03,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Miranda...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.17,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,So she was serving as an ambassador\Nin Karan at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.24,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I can confirm this letter is from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.95,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,So, you're here to see the governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:14.31,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The nation may be in turmoil, but I never \Nexpected such unusual messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.82,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,That's just like the new queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:21.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Are the two of you close?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:25.50,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Indeed. Until three years ago, \NI was one of her tutors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.32,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I mostly taught her diplomacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:36.26,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,You have my sincere gratitude \Nfor rescuing her in Archen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:41.46,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,However, the man you've \Ncome to see, Governor Bax...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.07,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,He's currently bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:46.09,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Getting an audience won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:48.38,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The governor is that gravely ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:51.56,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I've asked to see him numerous times,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:54.35,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,but I'm told he's not\N taking visitors in his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.60,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No visitors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.61,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:03.48,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,He has an obligation to meet\Nwith emissaries from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.51,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.68,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Why does she need so many guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:13.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Maybe they're afraid \Nof what the empire might pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:16.74,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I don't need to be present\Nif we're just negotiating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.74,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do my own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:19.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:21.61,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Be back before dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:23.07,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm not a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:24.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:33.09,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,It's an eyesore,\N but this is the Gargan embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:37.64,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Should anything happen there, \Nwe will not be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.53,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Exercise due caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.40,Default,GARGAN AMBASSADOR,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't Lady Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:45.31,Default,GARGAN AMBASSADOR,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:49.41,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,My, the Gargan ambassador himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.17,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.73,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,My name is Alzard Vane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:05.51,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I am the second-highest-ranking court \Nsorcerer of the Gargan Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.38,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,It is a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:14.05,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I was on my way to see the governor of Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:17.06,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Karan belongs to Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.60,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,As the Zirgian ambassador,\Nshouldn't I meet with him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:23.57,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Karan is a self-governing city-state.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:27.43,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I didn't think I needed Zirgus's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.59,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They hate each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:36.45,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It would seem interhuman \Ndiplomacy is also complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:41.40,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,We're actually on our way \Nto see the governor as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:42.96,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Why don't we go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.59,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I'd be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:47.59,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,By the way, who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:51.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I am Kyle Leonard, emissary of Queen Milena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:55.79,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're the hero of Zirgus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.48,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I'd been wondering, since I heard\Nyour name was Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.77,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,You do look a bit like Ceraia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You know my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:08.14,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,She and I were students together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:13.74,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years now, but we studied \Nmagic and other subjects side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:19.25,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I am most pleased to have \Nthe chance to meet her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.00,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:38.14,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,This job may be more fun than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:43.02,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Why can't we see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:47.00,Default,AGENT,0,0,0,,A-As I said, the governor \Nstill hasn't recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:49.15,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,You've said that for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:54.06,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If he's going to take much longer \Nto convalesce, then, as I've been suggesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:56.60,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,we'll have to appoint a new governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:07:58.41,Default,AGENT,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.48,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I'll return in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:04.78,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I hope you'll have good news for me by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:10.47,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,So, as you can see, \Nwe cannot meet with the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:12.42,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,It certainly appears that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:17.78,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,The empire was hoping to forge \Na friendly relationship with Karan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:20.49,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,but I'll return another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:30.58,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,He definitely knows the \Nengagement's being called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:31.57,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:34.38,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Coercion is the empire's go-to strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:37.94,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll begin issuing \Nall sorts of threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:42.81,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Alzard may even be trying to curry your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:51.96,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,So I'll appoint a new governor \Nbetter equipped to contend with the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You already have someone in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.59,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:59.40,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,A member of the blacksmith's guild\N and Karan's best blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.00,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,His name is Gazus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:12.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I should've known I wouldn't find anything\N just looking around normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:16.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,There aren't many girls around either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:20.57,Default,SCOUNDREL A,0,0,0,,Stop resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.62,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Please stop! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.62,Default,SCOUNDREL A,0,0,0,,Just stop—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.62,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Are you hurt, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.14,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.64,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:46.59,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Y-You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:49.40,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, though I get mistaken for a girl a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.24,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I can't believe myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:54.90,Default,SCOUNDREL C,0,0,0,,Wh-Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.15,Default,SCOUNDREL B,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, outsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:09:59.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Sorry for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:01.77,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.79,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Y-You're not going to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.04,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:07.70,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.45,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You got an older sister who looks like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:11.32,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I have one who's five years older.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.92,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,People say we look very much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:15.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves, scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:17.17,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm about to give you a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.68,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.32,Default,SCOUNDREL B,0,0,0,,The hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:24.06,Default,SCOUNDREL D,0,0,0,,Whatever! We can't let him beat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:27.73,Default,SCOUNDREL C,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.63,Default,SCOUNDREL A,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.93,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:42.36,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I was prepared to run\Nif things went south, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:44.10,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.76,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.37,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,My name is Goh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:50.08,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I'm an artificer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,An artificer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You make magic items?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:56.10,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.94,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Now then, who're these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:03.13,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,You see, they're debt collectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.72,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Debt collectors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:07.96,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I see. Your parents must be drunkards \Nor gambling addicts who—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:08.73,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,No, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.37,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,The debt is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:13.65,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then your parents are ill, \Nand to afford medicine—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:14.92,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,It's not that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.23,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Then what is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:21.51,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Their boss invested in a \Nmagic weapon I'm developing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:25.99,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,but he got mad when I told him\N it was going to take ten years to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:34.00,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I see. So you're a way worse \Nperson than your looks suggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.75,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Well, no skin off my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.87,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,For now, I'll escort you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:39.80,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Gotta introduce myself to your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:43.77,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... my sister is already married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Figures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:50.18,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You should've led with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:53.35,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I thought you might not save me if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:54.60,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Tee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.78,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You almost tricked me into \Nthinking you were cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.74,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,H-How could you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.24,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.83,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I'm a blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:07.24,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I've no interest in any other line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:11.63,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Gazus, Zirgus wants to provide\N even more support to Karan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.25,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,and work together to resolve our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:17.75,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You don't need my help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:20.13,Main - Top,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.13,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So that's Gazus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:22.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He's as stubborn as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:25.01,Main - Top,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,You're popular among the people, \Nand you're more than qualified and capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:25.01,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,This conversation is going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:27.31,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,It'll be tough to convince him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:28.41,Main - Top,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Please, Gazus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.23,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Appointing a dwarf as governor\N is an absurd idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.61,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.02,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, are you customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.27,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,What're you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We're here accompanying Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:43.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I was invited to stop by for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Apparently this dwarf named \NGazus is a skilled blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:52.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If all goes well, he might \Nbe able to make you a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:53.92,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:56.73,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You were thinking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:58.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Of course I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.11,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I intend to keep working you to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:03.05,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,That's the Kyle we know and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:05.67,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Miranda's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.74,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,This will take a while. \NWhy don't you come this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.29,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Sorry about the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:23.37,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You look human, but your father \Nis a dwarf, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:26.70,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not a dwarf. I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.81,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Me and my sister were my mother's\Nchildren from a prior relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:33.20,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Our mother passed away two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:37.20,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Since my sister got married a year ago,\N the house has been a sty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.33,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:41.40,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,That's a powerful adhesive that \Ncan't be unstuck once applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:42.84,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Warn me sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:14:00.65,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Oh, those are plans for the ancient \Nmagic weapon I'm attempting to restore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.24,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:11.62,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:15.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're the creator of that golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:19.39,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.54,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,There exist autonomous magic\Nweapons known as golems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:34.09,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,Most of the technology required \Nto create them was lost when Xarles fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.33,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,but towards the end of the Great Invasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:41.61,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,the Gargan Empire deployed \Na prototype against the demons
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:45.62,Main - Italics,KYLE/NA,0,0,0,,which achieved far more in battle \Nthan humanoid soldiers ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:51.20,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I see. This is well designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:54.82,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It's modeled off the Titan, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:56.51,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,You can tell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:15:00.04,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I made some improvements \Nbased on ancient texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:05.23,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed, there should be no issue swapping \Nthe power source from magical to mundane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What are the odds this'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:10.88,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Very high, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:12.98,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:16.39,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,Mass-producing these would be\N a huge boon to our forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:20.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Goh, you need to complete \Nthis golem as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:24.96,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,B-But it'll take another ten years, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's not fast enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.73,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Finish it within a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:31.50,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,But that would cost an absurd amount of mon—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:33.27,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Then spend like there's no tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:34.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll cover whatever you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.17,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:41.45,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Thank you for your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:44.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Also, keep this between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:47.60,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,But I already have a few other investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:50.84,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Tell them you failed and return \Ntheir investments in full!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:52.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I'll cover all that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.10,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:01.35,Main - Italics,GOH/ID,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:04.10,Main - Italics,GOH/ID,0,0,0,,I got myself a godly patron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:13.03,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,How did it go, Miranda?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.86,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,We got nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.63,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Gazus, I'll be back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:19.12,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:29.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Gazus, I'd like to make my own request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.62,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You want a sword or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:35.48,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm only accepting jobs \Nfrom regulars right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:39.19,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Dad, at least hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:42.14,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I think these people will be really helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.54,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.40,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I'm not prejudiced against elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:57.99,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I-I see. That's commendable for a dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.95,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'd like a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.16,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,My current one's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:07.24,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Oh? Looks like Dortos's handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:10.67,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Not many swordsmen can say his blades \Naren't good enough for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.72,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,Dad, Theron is super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.76,Default,GOH,0,0,0,,I doubt that sword's enough for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:16.55,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:19.90,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Ideally, I'd like one comparable to Kyle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.65,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Th-That sword...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:32.12,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Let me take a closer look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:39.62,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I've seen a few famous Xarles blades, \Nbut this one's on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.58,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I can't believe there was another one like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:43.83,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:49.21,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I'm not currently able to make you \Na sword comparable to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:53.48,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I guess Sildonia's really that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.70,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:58.34,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,There's no greater sword \Nforged by humanoid hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:06.06,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you'll have to leave for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:17.17,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting much, \Nbut he said something curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.80,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,About another sword like this one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.44,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Which suggests he's seen \Nsomething close to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:26.79,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Close to {\i1}me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.87,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I won't stand for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We can come back tomorrow \Nand see if he'll say more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:42.45,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's too bad about the sword, \Nbut the golem was a good find.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:49.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In my previous life, Goh must've \Nfailed to recreate the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:53.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He went bankrupt \Nand had to sell his blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:56.89,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Then when the empire acquired them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:19:00.41,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,they were able to make a prototype\N toward the end of the Great Invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:04.78,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,From a technological standpoint, \Nwe should probably seek the empire's aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:12.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,But if we share too much with them now, \Nthey'll grow too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:17.34,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Queen Milena calling off the engagement \Nwill wear on relations between our countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:22.68,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If we're not careful, war could break out \Nbetween humans before the Great Invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:26.68,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'd actually find that rather interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.88,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:29.42,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.44,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:37.74,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Forgive the early morning visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:42.70,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd like to chat\Nwith the son of my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.95,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:47.02,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Why don't we have lunch together later?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:50.18,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Your friends and the ambassador \Nare welcome to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:53.33,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,We could even cruise through \Nthe skies on wyverns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.72,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I thought the skills to ride \Nthem were a state secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.04,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:04.56,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,It was Ceraia who established the \Ntechniques for riding wyverns, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,My mother did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.86,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Ceraia was quite talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:16.97,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I may be older, but I always \Naspired to be like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now she's just a lazy housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.95,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I suppose that, too, is not unlike her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:29.63,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll see you at the Gargan embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:31.63,Default,ALZARD,0,0,0,,I look forward to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:38.36,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I thought so yesterday as well, \Nbut his magic power is substantial.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:39.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:44.72,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Yes. He's got enough to cast high-level spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:48.47,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,He may even be able to cast \Nspecial-grade spells someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:50.36,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Special-grade spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:55.90,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The empire's court sorcerers are no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:05.07,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The others didn't need to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:08.24,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,They're not fond of formal meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:15.96,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.46,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:22.67,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:32.52,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Kyle, what is the—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:00.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}Those Who Act Out of Sight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:39.43,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "Those Who Act Out of Sight."
